 <span class="price-20-off">50% off regular price</span>, automatically applied at checkout.'=>'Bonus: WPForms Lite users get <span class="price-20-off">50% off regular price</span>, automatically applied at checkout.','Get WPForms Pro Today and Unlock all the Powerful Features'=>'Get WPForms Pro Today and Unlock all the Powerful Features','Thanks for being a loyal WPForms Lite user. <strong>Upgrade to WPForms Pro</strong> to unlock all the awesome features and experience<br>why WPForms is consistently rated the best WordPress form builder.'=>'Thanks for being a loyal WPForms Lite user. <strong>Upgrade to WPForms Pro</strong> to unlock all the awesome features and experience<br>why WPForms is consistently rated the best WordPress form builder.','How to Display Forms on Your Site'=>'How to Display Forms on Your Site','How to Customize Form Fields'=>'How to Customise Form Fields','How to Add a New Form'=>'How to Add a New Form','In the Forms Overview page, the forms list will be empty because there are no forms yet. To create a new form, click on the Add New button, and this will launch the WPForms Form Builder.'=>'In the Forms Overview page, the forms list will be empty because there are no forms yet. To create a new form, click on the Add New button, and this will launch the WPForms Form Builder.','Want to get started creating your first form with WPForms? By following the step by step instructions in this walkthrough, you can easily publish your first form on your site.'=>'Want to get started creating your first form with WPForms? By following the step by step instructions in this walkthrough, you can easily publish your first form on your site.','Creating Your First Form'=>'Creating Your First Form','Status: %s'=>'Status: %s','Install Plugin'=>'Install Plugin','The WPForms Team photo'=>'The WPForms Team photo','Yup, we know a thing or two about building awesome products that customers love.'=>'Yup, we know a thing or two about building awesome products that customers love.','Our goal is to take the pain out of creating online forms and make it easy.'=>'Our goal is to take the pain out of creating online forms and make it easy.','Over the years, we found that most WordPress contact form plugins were bloated, buggy, slow, and very hard to use. So we started with a simple goal: build a WordPress forms plugin that’s both easy and powerful.'=>'Over the years, we found that most WordPress contact form plugins were bloated, buggy, slow, and very hard to use. So we started with a simple goal: build a WordPress forms plugin that’s both easy and powerful.','Hello and welcome to WPForms, the most beginner friendly drag & drop WordPress forms plugin. At WPForms, we build software that helps you create beautiful responsive online forms for your website in minutes.'=>'Hello and welcome to WPForms, the most beginner friendly drag & drop WordPress forms plugin. At WPForms, we build software that helps you create beautiful responsive online forms for your website in minutes.','Getting Started'=>'Getting Started','Advanced Form Features'=>'Advanced Form Features','Surveys & Polls'=>'Surveys & Polls','Payment Forms'=>'Payment Forms','Marketing Integrations'=>'Marketing Integrations','Form Fields'=>'Form Fields','Addon installed.'=>'Addon installed.','Plugin installed.'=>'Plugin installed.','Addon installed & activated.'=>'Addon installed & activated.','Plugin installed & activated.'=>'Plugin installed & activated.','Addon activated.'=>'Addon activated.','Plugin activated.'=>'Plugin activated.','Could not deactivate the addon. Please deactivate from the Plugins page.'=>'Could not deactivate the addon. Please deactivate from the Plugins page.','Addon deactivated.'=>'Addon deactivated.','Plugin deactivated.'=>'Plugin deactivated.','About Us'=>'About Us','About WPForms'=>'About WPForms','No choices to choose from'=>'No choices to choose from','No results found'=>'No results found','Loading...'=>'Loading…','You\'ve selected <strong>No Styling</stro